Revision history for Web-Plain

0.01  unreleased
    - First version: Flask-like routes as plain functions (get, post, put, patch, del, any, route; :name and
      *name parameters), requests as plain hashes, responses as [status, headers, body] (a hash becomes JSON,
      a string text), json / text / stream / sse helpers, and a small sequential HTTP/1.1 server on a unix
      socket (or host:port) for behind nginx: streamed responses, client-gone detection, limits, SIGTERM.
